                    The Web Based Public Tender System was born from a simple belief: that every citizen
                    deserves a government that spends transparently. When we started this journey as students
                    in Damak, people told us it was too ambitious. But we saw a broken system and refused to
                    look away. Today, our platform is not just a tool &mdash; it's a promise to Nepal that
                    procurement can be fair, digital, and
