                    <img src="~/Images/ichha.jpeg" alt="Ichha Chaulagain" class="message-avatar" />
                    <div class="message-avatar-ring"></div>
                </div>
                <span class="message-name">Ichha Chaulagain</span>
                <span class="message-role">CEO</span>
            </div>
            <div class="message-content">
                <div class="message-quote-mark">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-quote-left fa-2x" style="opacity: 0.15;"></i>
                </div>
                <blockquote class="message-text">
                    Running a technology company is about more than code and servers &mdash; it's about people.
                    Every vendor who finds a fair opportunity, every agency that saves taxpayer money, every
                    process that becomes a little more honest &mdash; that's what drives us. At our platform, we measure
                    success not in revenue, but in the trust we build. Damak gave us roots, but our vision is
